WEBVTT

NOTE
Deling City parade procession continues. Edea's float with Seifer moves through the boulevard and arrives at the presidential residence.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Overhead view. Edea's float glides through the crowd, its cyan energy ring spinning above.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Seifer smirks from the float, gunblade at his side, fireworks behind him.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Edea and Seifer silhouetted against the night sky atop the glowing float.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Street level. The float rolls down the boulevard past stilt performers and cheering crowds.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
The float approaches the presidential residence with its clock tower and red banners.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Fireworks burst above the residence as the procession arrives.
